{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o076d","title":"夏侯尚徙昌陵乡侯","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o076d-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"夏侯尚徙昌陵乡侯","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o076d-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0063","role":"徙封","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o076d-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":224,"label":"黄初五年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xiahoucao-y224","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xiahoucao-q-o076","basis":"黄初五年"},"evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o076d-q","xiahoucao-q-o076","xiahoucao-q-b-fddc958c175f1a5b52aa"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o076d-q","source_order":[9,392,"O076d"],"order":2326}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0063","name":"夏侯尚","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o076d-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-9bfe77ade6e9f77acfac","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖5〗，徙封昌陵乡侯。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":391,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":187,"end":200},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-b-fddc958c175f1a5b52aa","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-fddc958c175f1a5b52aa","layer":"modern","quote":"〖5〗五年：黄初五年（公元 224）。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e58fb6ef2c9c3d032015","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o076","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-9bfe77ade6e9f77acfac","layer":"original","quote":"黄初三年，车驾幸宛，使尚率诸军，与曹真共围江陵。权将诸葛瑾与尚军对江。瑾渡，入江中渚，而分水军于江中。尚夜多持油船，将步骑万余人，于下流潜渡，攻瑾诸军。夹江烧其舟船，水陆并攻。破之，城未拔；会大疫，诏敕尚引诸军还。益封六百户，并前千九百户；假钺，进为牧。荆州残荒，外接蛮夷；而与吴阻汉水为境，旧民多居江南。尚自上庸通道，西行七百余里，山民蛮夷多服从者；五六年间，降附数千家。五年〖5〗，徙封昌陵乡侯。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":391,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":200}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
